{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-12-14","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：圆柱与圆锥","englishTitle":"Cones and cylinders which are on equal bases are to one another as their heights.","book":12,"number":14,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.14","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.14/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":14,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-12-14@raw-b802540ac0afab95","contentId":"euclid-12-14","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b802540ac0afab9594faf9806763e13317b95bb7e035a5e48697079408943dd5","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-12-14.statement","euclid-12-14.construction.1","euclid-12-14.construction.2","euclid-12-14.proof.1","euclid-12-14.proof.2","euclid-12-14.proof.3","euclid-12-14.proof.4","euclid-12-14.proof.5","euclid-12-14.conclusion","euclid-12-14.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-12-14.statement","contentId":"euclid-12-14","revisionId":"euclid-12-14@raw-b802540ac0afab95","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2821bbec788e6ef973ea27054ece52bc95dfb5d2bf6ec9d8c5c9e08d521e9ee9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Cones and cylinders which are on equal bases are to one another as their heights."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"等同底边的锥形和圆筒,彼此高度相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-14.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-12-14","revisionId":"euclid-12-14@raw-b802540ac0afab95","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a6c12a88a1e78ad8218330cf4960bc3d9598c2f3fd7383af8fa735780eb45c77","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let EB, FD be cylinders on equal bases, the circles AB, CD; I say that, as the cylinder EB is to the cylinder FD, so is the axis GH to the axis KL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EB,FD气瓶在等于底边的圆圈上,AB,CD;我说,气瓶EB与气瓶FD的比等于轴GH与轴KL的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-14.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-12-14","revisionId":"euclid-12-14@raw-b802540ac0afab95","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2260e33b209167f7dc4a1cad310b1f6ae8339a179e6b55b748950c2f9c1f894e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the axis KL be produced to the point N, let LN be made equal to the axis GH, and let the cylinder CM be conceived about LN as axis."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将KL轴延伸至N点,将LN轴与GH轴等同,将CM气瓶作为轴数约LN。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-14.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-12-14","revisionId":"euclid-12-14@raw-b802540ac0afab95","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5157777902482233c7abadbe479e5ad5a567d17365c73325c3d2a05e41dd2991","citations":["euclid-12-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the cylinders EB, CM are of the same height, they are to one another as their bases. [[XII. 11](/principles/euclid-12-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,EB,CM气瓶的高度与底边气瓶的高度相同。 [[XII. 11](/principles/euclid-12-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-14.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-12-14","revisionId":"euclid-12-14@raw-b802540ac0afab95","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a0a0e745c6cc96cf2a7d63b1f22fd2be80bae6cc05d06a905ee9f5eb4625d72a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the bases are equal to one another; therefore the cylinders EB, CM are also equal."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是底边是等同的,因此EB,CM也相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-14.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-12-14","revisionId":"euclid-12-14@raw-b802540ac0afab95","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7494c5954bf7e05eb6d66e4e981e45a6a907c6159970be295b9366003f2a1e2","citations":["euclid-12-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the cylinder FM has been cut by the plane CD which is parallel to its opposite planes, therefore, as the cylinder CM is to the cylinder FD, so is the axis LN to the axis KL. [[XII. 13](/principles/euclid-12-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于FM气瓶被与平面气瓶平行的平面 CD气瓶切割,因此,CM气瓶与FD气瓶的比等于LN轴与KL气瓶的比。 [[XII. 13](/principles/euclid-12-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-14.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-12-14","revisionId":"euclid-12-14@raw-b802540ac0afab95","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"35c660ce82f10b3d7e650294df2b8e3879f74c6802a4a49ae46c2ad9c3bc009a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the cylinder CM is equal to the cylinder EB, and the axis LN to the axis GH; therefore, as the cylinder EB is to the cylinder FD, so is the axis GH to the axis KL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CM气瓶等于EB气瓶,LN轴与GH轴等于EB气瓶与FD气瓶的比等于GH气瓶与KL气瓶的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-14.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-12-14","revisionId":"euclid-12-14@raw-b802540ac0afab95","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"56402d9cf1c79f0111449b907ebb33fe8c9d791532022a0c0184f1d6eabbe3e7","citations":["euclid-12-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the cylinder EB is to the cylinder FD, so is the cone ABG to the cone CDK. [[XII. 10](/principles/euclid-12-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,EB气瓶与FD气瓶的比等于ABG气瓶与CDK气瓶的比。 [[XII. 10](/principles/euclid-12-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-14.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-12-14","revisionId":"euclid-12-14@raw-b802540ac0afab95","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"64f59b3a04784fa2b9c68f3ab5ec561d855d201bd98ac38041f0bf8e84c72d17","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as the axis GH is to the axis KL, so is the cone ABG to the cone CDK and the cylinder EB to the cylinder FD. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,轴GH与轴KL之比也等于锥体ABG与锥体CDK之比,圆柱EB与圆柱FD之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-14.source","contentId":"euclid-12-14","revisionId":"euclid-12-14@raw-b802540ac0afab95","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b86a28cb41f3a8246ac7766158541153e41f597780dc17ac92c3637929e05140","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.14/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.14\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-12-14:euclid-12-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-14.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-12-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"XII. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-14:euclid-12-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-14.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-12-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"XII. 13"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-14:euclid-12-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-14.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-12-10","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"XII. 10"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-14:euclid-12-11:explicit","id":"euclid-12-11","book":12,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：圆柱与圆锥","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-14:euclid-12-13:explicit","id":"euclid-12-13","book":12,"number":13,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：圆柱与平面与平行线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-14:euclid-12-10:explicit","id":"euclid-12-10","book":12,"number":10,"kind":"proposition","title":"圆锥体积是同底同高圆柱的三分之一","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-solid","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
